cff-version: 1.2.0
title: LithoCloud
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
abstract: >-
  LithoCloud hosts rock-slope point-cloud pipelines as independent engines:
  ingest, registration, fusion, preprocessing, surface-condition
  classification, and structural / hazard analysis of LiDAR and
  photogrammetric data.
